{"slug": "opening-tramlijn-naar-wassenaar", "synopsis": "This 1923 film records celebrations for the opening of a new HTM tram line between The Hague and Wassenaar. Uniformed musicians lead processions, while garlanded trams carry invited guests along the route. Passengers leave the cars at decorated stops, including Restaurant De Kieviet, where officials, residents, and large crowds gather.\\\\n\\\\nThe festivities include formal speeches, floral displays, music, and outdoor hospitality. Onlookers line the tracks as the trams pass, and the band later marches through a tree-lined setting. Near the end, viewers see a model tram and station before a speaker addresses the gathering from behind a mass of flowers.", "clips": [{"id": "0ff142fb-e58f-566b-941f-9ed6fa7ae5ac", "sourceSlug": "opening-tramlijn-naar-wassenaar", "sourceTitle": "Opening tramlijn naar Wassenaar", "sourceYear": 1923, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 6.04, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/opening-tramlijn-naar-wassenaar/clips/0000000000-0000006040.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/opening-tramlijn-naar-wassenaar/thumbnails/0000000000-0000006040.jpg"}, {"id": "4d5fb099-b8a1-511b-b2ea-f06bc826c7c3", "sourceSlug": "opening-tramlijn-naar-wassenaar", "sourceTitle": "Opening tramlijn naar Wassenaar", "sourceYear": 1923, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 6.04, "endSeconds": 11.4, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/opening-tramlijn-naar-wassenaar/clips/0000006040-0000011400.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/opening-tramlijn-naar-wassenaar/thumbnails/0000006040-0000011400.jpg"}, {"id": "3998fb62-c8fd-596d-bfe0-cb776972ad14", "sourceSlug": "opening-tramlijn-naar-wassenaar", "sourceTitle": "Opening tramlijn naar Wassenaar", "sourceYear": 1923, "position": 2, "startSeconds": 11.4, "endSeconds": 24.6, "videoUrl": "https://pub-